Underlying full-text Markdown files were generated from open-access papers via
the MinerU and Docling toolchains. Paper-level rights remain with their original
authors and publishers; this dataset releases ONLY the derived structured
representations (closed-loop records, gene diffs, lineage trajectories, agentic
episodes), which constitute new intellectual property over the underlying papers.
